{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18682","headline":"戏题石门长老东轩 · 柳宗元","name":"戏题石门长老东轩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石门长老身如梦，旃檀成林手所种。\n坐来念念非昔人，万徧莲花爲谁用。\n如今七十自忘机，贪爱都忘筋力微。\n莫向东轩春埜望，花开日出雉皆飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}